  "_comment": "Nepal public holidays, Gregorian dates. Maintained by hand once a year when the Office of the Prime Minister and Council of Ministers publishes the gazette. No API carries Nepal reliably: Nager.Date omits NP entirely, and the alternatives either need a key or block scripted requests. Keep this sorted, keep 'type' honest, and delete nothing -- a past date stays historically correct even after the gazette is superseded.",
