    "type": "public = nationwide day off. optional = restricted leave (Teej is women only). local = regional (Gai Jatra is Newar, Gaura Parwa is Sudurpashchim). observances are noted but not days off.",
    "provisional": "Optional flag, set only where the gazette has not been published yet and the date is a recurring fixed-date observance carried forward. Lunar-calendar dates in a future BS year genuinely cannot be known until the gazette appears, so they are marked rather than silently presented as fact. The UI labels these differently."
